s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/6bd8916648a1133c6f25a78667dc9b20.poster.avif?t=1760817708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/6bd8916648a1133c6f25a78667dc9b20.webm?t=1760817708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/6bd8916648a1133c6f25a78667dc9b20.mp4?t=1760817708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your reach beyond a single world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each miniature planet in your system is fully explorable, small enough to traverse on foot, or even orbit, yet large enough to host a growing settlement. Jump between planets while making sure that you have enough oxygen to survive the journey. Survey new environments, discover natural landmarks, find new resource locations, and unlock advanced structures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/1628e7366d68f5c42240ebe657a0ea7d.poster.avif?t=1760817708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/1628e7366d68f5c42240ebe657a0ea7d.webm?t=1760817708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/1628e7366d68f5c42240ebe657a0ea7d.mp4?t=1760817708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings, manage resources, and nurture your population. As your community grows, new opportunities emerge. Every settlement contributes to the larger star system you\u2019re developing. Expand beyond a single planet, creating system spanning colonies that work together and share resources to support your growing population.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/dc5f3046259afb4d27eeee1604a4b4d9.poster.avif?t=1760817708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/dc5f3046259afb4d27eeee1604a4b4d9.webm?t=1760817708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/dc5f3046259afb4d27eeee1604a4b4d9.mp4?t=1760817708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your system thrives and your population surpasses the critical milestone of one hundred settlers, a new frontier opens.\u00a0Construct the Warp Junction, a monumental gateway linking your star system to the wider galaxy. This achievement not only marks the culmination of your mission \u2014 it signals that life beyond the Inner Sphere is not only possible but sustainable.\u00a0Your success becomes a beacon, inviting future settlers to follow in your footsteps and turning your once-isolated outposts into the foundation of humanity\u2019s next great chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/d9e63e0aae91e7ce511bbb2760ae12be.poster.avif?t=1760817708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a